#: ../../../source/developer/rust_idaklu_build.md:14
msgid "**How the pieces connect:**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/developer/rust_idaklu_build.md:16
msgid ""
"`pybamm-python` implements `pybamm.rust`, which provides the Python API over "
"the Rust code in `pybamm-core`, which compiles expressions into evaluable "
"functions and sparse Jacobians."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/developer/rust_idaklu_build.md:20
msgid "Prerequisites"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/developer/rust_idaklu_build.md:22
msgid ""
"**Rust 1.89+**: `curl --proto '=https' --tlsv1.2 -sSf https://sh.rustup.rs | "
"sh`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/developer/rust_idaklu_build.md:23
msgid "**uv**: `curl -LsSf https://astral.sh/uv/install.sh | sh`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/developer/rust_idaklu_build.md:24
msgid "**CMake 3.22+** (the bundled SuiteSparse's floor) and a C++17 compiler"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/developer/rust_idaklu_build.md:25
msgid ""
"**BLAS and a Fortran compiler** for SuiteSparse, e.g. `libopenblas-dev "
"gfortran`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/developer/rust_idaklu_build.md:26
msgid "**macOS only**: Homebrew with `libomp` (`brew install libomp`)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/developer/rust_idaklu_build.md:28
msgid "Quick start"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/developer/rust_idaklu_build.md:30
msgid ""
"One sync builds everything — the hatch build hook compiles "
"`pybamm.rust._core` in release mode, and pybammsolvers builds SUNDIALS/"
"SuiteSparse from its bundled submodules on first build:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/developer/rust_idaklu_build.md:34
msgid ""
"git clone https://github.com/pybamm-team/PyBaMM.git\n"
"cd PyBaMM\n"
"git submodule update --init --recursive\n"
"uv sync --extra all --group dev\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/developer/rust_idaklu_build.md:41
msgid "Verify the extension imports:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/developer/rust_idaklu_build.md:43
msgid ""
"uv run python -c \"\n"
"from pybamm.rust import ExprGraph\n"
"print('Rust bindings:', ExprGraph)\n"
"\"\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/developer/rust_idaklu_build.md:50
msgid "Rebuilding after changes"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/developer/rust_idaklu_build.md:52
msgid ""
"`uv`'s cache keys cover the Rust sources, so `uv sync --extra all --group "
"dev` or `uv run` rebuilds `pybamm.rust._core` whenever a `.rs` file changes."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/developer/rust_idaklu_build.md:55
msgid "Running tests"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/developer/rust_idaklu_build.md:57
msgid ""
"# Rust unit + contract tests\n"
"cd packages/pybamm-rust && cargo test --workspace\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/developer/rust_idaklu_build.md:62
msgid "Running benchmarks"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/developer/rust_idaklu_build.md:64
msgid ""
"# Rust micro-benchmarks (Criterion); --all-features runs those that need "
"`serialize`\n"
"cd packages/pybamm-rust && cargo bench -p pybamm-core --all-features\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/developer/rust_idaklu_build.md:69
msgid "Troubleshooting"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/developer/rust_idaklu_build.md:71
msgid "`pybamm.rust._core` import fails"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/developer/rust_idaklu_build.md:73
msgid "uv sync --extra all --group dev --reinstall-package pybamm\n"
msgstr ""
